Drupal 11.4 compatibility for drupal/media_thumbnails_video 2.0.2.

Drupal 11.4 core added a native `: array` return type to
FileVideoFormatter::viewElements() and three required constructor parameters
($currentUser, $imageStyleStorage, $entityFieldManager). 2.0.2's
VideoExtendedFormatter overrides both, so on 11.4 PHP fails with
"Declaration of ...VideoExtendedFormatter::viewElements(...) must be compatible
with ...FileVideoFormatter::viewElements(...): array".

This is upstream's fix from the 2.1.x branch (commits 08a1c8d "Making
VideoExtendedFormatter.php drupal 11.4 compatible" and 8df07a1 "Fix
__construct() in VideoExtendedFormatter to match parent core class"), which has
no tagged release yet. core_version_requirement becomes ^11.4 because the fixed
constructor only works on 11.4+.

Drop this patch and the 2.0.2 pin once upstream tags a 2.1.x release; require
that instead.

